======================

mls-rs
------
The MLS (RFC 9420) protocol core is provided by mls-rs, vendored under
external/mls-rs and built as a Soong Rust module.

    Copyright (c) Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.

    Licensed under either of the Apache License, Version 2.0 or the MIT
    license, at your option. See external/mls-rs for the full texts.

This project links mls-rs through a thin FFI layer (rust/) and a JNI bridge
(jni/mls_openmls_bridge.c). The RCC.16 credential and proposal handling built
on top of it is original work and is licensed as above.

